<article class="markdown-body">
<h1>{{title}}</h1>
<div class="forma-deck">
<span class="forma-sh"><span class="k">类型</span><span class="v pink">结构抽取</span></span>
<span class="forma-sh"><span class="k">输出</span><span class="v gray">可复用骨架</span></span>
</div>
<p class="forma-lede">不复读金句；输出可迁移的叙事骨架。</p>
<h2>拆解要点</h2>
<p>{{structure}}</p>
<h2>骨架</h2>
<div class="forma-quote">{{skeleton}}</div>
<h2>改写稿</h2>
{{#rewriteParagraphs}}
<p>{{.}}</p>
{{/rewriteParagraphs}}
{{^rewriteParagraphs}}
<p>{{rewrite}}</p>
{{/rewriteParagraphs}}
{{#handoffPrompt}}
<hr>
<p><button type="button" data-forma-action="handoff" data-forma-skill-id="xhs-note" data-forma-prompt="{{handoffPrompt}}">按骨架写笔记</button></p>
{{/handoffPrompt}}
</article>
